WEBVTT

00:20:29.224 --> 00:20:31.268
and you bend it, bend it,
bend it, bend it,

00:20:31.268 --> 00:20:33.436
and you feel where
you're bending, it's warm.

00:20:33.436 --> 00:20:35.021
It's really the same process.

00:20:35.021 --> 00:20:37.482
It's that flexing is what warms these.

00:20:37.482 --> 00:20:41.069
So for Europa in orbit around Jupiter,

00:20:41.069 --> 00:20:45.448
we have the water,
we have the rocky surface deep inside.

00:20:45.448 --> 00:20:46.866
We have warmth.

00:20:46.866 --> 00:20:49.786
We've got this energy source thing.

00:20:49.828 --> 00:20:52.455
So is it possible
that life has formed there?

00:20:53.957 --> 00:20:55.417
Sure.

00:20:55.458 --> 00:20:57.085
Who am I to say no?

00:20:57.127 --> 00:20:58.503
I mean, what do I know?

00:20:58.545 --> 00:21:03.508
I mean, the universe is much more complex
than I can imagine.